gtk: vmlab: one full screen button in the title bar, and files dropped on the window

The VMLAB_WINDOW window's title bar holds a single round button at its right, left of the
window's own buttons: full screen, which Ctrl+Alt+F leaves (and enters). It replaces the two
menu buttons of 0006 and 0008: the menus are no longer shown at all, their keys work as
before. (An open menu's popup also crashed mutter 46.2 when QEMU died under it.) The button
takes no keyboard focus, so keys stay the guest's.

Files dragged onto the window are sent to the guest (qemu_vdagent_send_file, 0009). (The
user's request.)

